Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: iommu: arm,smmu: Add SM6450 SMMU
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

SM6450's apps SMMU is an MMU-500 with 96 context banks.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/arm,smmu.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/arm,smmu.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/arm,smmu.yaml
index 89495f094..94d6537de 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/arm,smmu.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/arm,smmu.yaml
@@ -56,6 +56,7 @@ properties:
               - qcom,sm6125-smmu-500
               - qcom,sm6350-smmu-500
               - qcom,sm6375-smmu-500
+              - qcom,sm6450-smmu-500
               - qcom,sm8150-smmu-500
               - qcom,sm8250-smmu-500
               - qcom,sm8350-smmu-500
